{"time": 1757605561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95292947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“谁来做东是轮流的！这周正好轮到修人犯！我们在聚会上疯狂地喝酒，然后，玩游戏哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。”"}
{"time": 1757605572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191105821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（哦，那个修四白我改名字了"}
{"time": 1757605578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408804456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（改成修北海"}
