{"time": 1757605602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937812531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1757605616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774553183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（下一句）"}
{"time": 1757605639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261731540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们的习惯就是在聚会上互相吃掉彼此，吃掉之后拟态成对面的样子！吓唬吓唬大伙！然后吃人的人恢复原状，被吃的人把肢体重新长出来！大家该聚会聚会呀呀呀呀呀！“"}
{"time": 1757605766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670274672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*皱皱眉，但没说什么"}
{"time": 1757605792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640980325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们修格斯就是一种只要吃掉一个生物就可以拟态成 ta 的样子的邪神啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"}
{"time": 1757605843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976570999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（嗯嗯）"}
{"time": 1757605874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090916830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那天我们彼此吃了很多次，修人犯当然也吃了修北海嗷嗷嗷嗷。”"}
{"time": 1757605946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346604954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“那天不止杀人犯吃了修北海吗”"}
{"time": 1757606017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900365423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你这么一说，好像只有他一个修吃了修北海吼吼吼吼吼”"}
{"time": 1757606040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956445601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*点点头"}
{"time": 1757606064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765016651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "//“当时灯光昏暗，我们也都喝多了，我没当回事，现在我想了想，修北海被吃了之后确实没有再站起来过啊啊啊啊啊啊。”"}
{"time": 1757606090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227310349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（其实我应该在证词前面加标识的，但是我刚才忘了（"}
{"time": 1757606094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298315677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“那杀人犯吃完修北海之后变成他了吗”"}
{"time": 1757606202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432298382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是的哦哦哦哦哦”"}
{"time": 1757606257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4021122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "//“之后我们玩够了就各自回家了啊啊啊啊啊。”"}
{"time": 1757606286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771393074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“容我多嘴，那你们是如何在灯光昏暗和醉酒的情况下分辨变形前后谁是谁的呢”"}
{"time": 1757606359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750231765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们都长一个样！但是我们会在头上拟态出一个帽子或者发型吼啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊，平时见得多了肯定能认清修哦哦哦哦哦”"}
{"time": 1757606415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734670479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（下一条吧）"}
{"time": 1757606432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579609543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*点点头"}
{"time": 1757606446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314659987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "//“今天早上我想来找修人犯玩，结果推开门发现客厅的地板上躺着修北海！他上半身已经没了，也没再长出来吼嗷嗷嗷嗷！”"}
{"time": 1757606665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745314846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“我有个问题：在可能有拟态的情况下，你是通过什么方式来确定那半拉是修北海的呢”"}
{"time": 1757606754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968248687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个确实没法确定，不过我们社区就这么多修，如果没有修失踪的话就只能是修北海了吼啊啊啊啊啊啊”"}
{"time": 1757606846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077394677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "//“大概的事情就是这样啊啊啊啊啊！”"}
{"time": 1757606858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559019097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“也就是说，你无法百分百确定在地上的是修北海或是杀人犯吗”"}
{"time": 1757606978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201419636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“为什么不能确定啊啊啊啊啊，社区里只少了修北海一只修哦哦哦哦哦”"}
{"time": 1757607038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131259389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "//“虽然我确定是修人犯吃了修北海没错，但是正常来说我们修格斯被吃了也可以复原的！所以修北海没理由会死啊啊啊啊啊啊！”\n“所以，请你一定要明察秋毫啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"}
{"time": 1757607056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391093589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".rd5+5"}
