{"time": 1757607067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203297061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（自由提问"}
{"time": 1757607113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612329752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“那么，如果有修北海拟态成了杀人犯，然后吃掉了拟态成修北海的杀人犯这种情况的话，你能分辨出来么”"}
{"time": 1757607251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061204520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“分辨不出来吼吼吼吼”"}
{"time": 1757607268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266781767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1022805967", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢你的配合”"}
